  "body": "<p>This Pull Request updates dependency <a href=\"https://github.com/superwolff/metalsmith-in-place\">metalsmith-in-place</a> from <code>v2.0.1</code> to <code>v3.0.1</code></p>\n<h3 id=\"commits\">Commits</h3>\n<p><details><br />\n<summary>superwolff/metalsmith-in-place</summary></p>\n<h4 id=\"301\">3.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/superwolff/metalsmith-in-place/commit/49f1becfa3cbd74035000e2c03c687aaba6678e0\"><code>49f1bec</code></a> Prepare 3.0.1 (#&#8203;112)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"300\">3.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/superwolff/metalsmith-in-place/commit/9ba6c41dccc4f560e60460f21b30e0c90c77fdaa\"><code>9ba6c41</code></a> Prepare 3.0.0 (#&#8203;109)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/superwolff/metalsmith-in-place/commit/cba0fec8060ceea8715280ccbaa6c2496d11b308\"><code>cba0fec</code></a> Accept array as pattern (#&#8203;108)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/superwolff/metalsmith-in-place/commit/61cc7f1482c156c599eb959cf63d7603b63b579f\"><code>61cc7f1</code></a> chore(package): update husky to version 0.14.3 (#&#8203;103)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/superwolff/metalsmith-in-place/commit/27d397cbb15c1416f732b6459196c0e0e7900144\"><code>27d397c</code></a> chore(package): update lint-staged to version 4.0.1 (#&#8203;104)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/superwolff/metalsmith-in-place/commit/f46c0468a7ca8e7c921d8cb3fba649bd0fb83149\"><code>f46c046</code></a> Ignore eslint for greenkeeper (#&#8203;105)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/superwolff/metalsmith-in-place/commit/e3de12603c339b42443fb3c50c999c3ccf48e6fb\"><code>e3de126</code></a> Minor updates (#&#8203;99)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/superwolff/metalsmith-in-place/commit/d627d886ea8a8d015b85aee4cf78a3afde266e56\"><code>d627d88</code></a> Update travis config (#&#8203;97)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/superwolff/metalsmith-in-place/commit/de3ddcb10d9381e47ca85c254e817249d615b333\"><code>de3ddcb</code></a> Add prettier (#&#8203;95)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/superwolff/metalsmith-in-place/commit/fe22dc1e2a0d8da2e1caa2a6ff4b5cada29148d5\"><code>fe22dc1</code></a> Use babel-preset-env (#&#8203;94)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/superwolff/metalsmith-in-place/commit/4953de86ee374f83d2978397e9a56dafd441c796\"><code>4953de8</code></a> Add coverage (#&#8203;93)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/superwolff/metalsmith-in-place/commit/2d6af7f003b14e508710fe9118998e1a5d394449\"><code>2d6af7f</code></a> Update dependencies to enable Greenkeeper 🌴 (#&#8203;92)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/superwolff/metalsmith-in-place/commit/d12fc43d3d9da551d5ef39eca88235f58bba082f\"><code>d12fc43</code></a> Rename history (#&#8203;90)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/superwolff/metalsmith-in-place/commit/2d4cc338401c4bb7a1125bbdfd107d4c60504e28\"><code>2d4cc33</code></a> Add jest (#&#8203;89)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/superwolff/metalsmith-in-place/commit/e093f796a1eb6baa2f46ae43a7208d574329acb6\"><code>e093f79</code></a> Add issue template (#&#8203;88)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/superwolff/metalsmith-in-place/commit/6af2f9065469c7dc397f2dc9b5838382abee2b8e\"><code>6af2f90</code></a> Run eslint on travis as well (#&#8203;83)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/superwolff/metalsmith-in-place/commit/eb1e673c010237e3332a71b3c544166325ac3293\"><code>eb1e673</code></a> Update Readme.md (#&#8203;79)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/superwolff/metalsmith-in-place/commit/f9fa4c6b92193bfaae3522c63cf9498e886add4d\"><code>f9fa4c6</code></a> 2.0.1</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/superwolff/metalsmith-in-place/commit/0f45990e13897379b053675569658302aa0c6f5b\"><code>0f45990</code></a> 2.0.1</li>\n</ul>\n<p></details></p>\n<hr />\n<p>This PR has been generated by <a href=\"https://renovateapp.com\">Renovate Bot</a>.</p>",
